<item>
<title>人社部：要把未参保人员都找到“动员参保”人社部近日在国新办发布会上称，三项社保参保规模居全球首位，其中基本养老9月底达1</title>
<link>https://t.me/OutsightChina/10320</link>
<guid isPermaLink="true">https://t.me/OutsightChina/10320</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 11 Oct 2026 13:00:44 +0000</pubDate>
<description><![CDATA[<div><div class="tgme_widget_message_text js-message_text" dir="auto"><b>人社部：要把未参保人员都找到“动员参保”</b><br/><br/>人社部近日在国新办发布会上称，三项社保参保规模居全球首位，其中基本养老9月底达10.79亿人，但“现在还有一些人没有参保”，要通过“数据找人”等方式动员参保，力争“十五五”期间养老参保率稳定在95%以上。<br/><br/>他称重点是鼓励灵活就业人员、农民工和新就业形态人员参加职工养老保险，并建立用工方、平台企业和劳动者分担缴费的机制。<br/><br/>相关话题登上微博热搜。有博主指“灵活就业群体交房租、吃饭都把钱分完了，社保自然排后面”。据路透社7月报道指，非强制缴纳社保零工岗位激增，加剧了资金本就不足的社保所面临的长期风险。记者访问了12名灵活就业人员，只有2名愿意交社保，有受访者称：“我可以自己掌控，而不是苦等几十年让别人给我发钱”。<br/><br/><a href="?q=%23%E7%A4%BE%E4%BC%9A">#社会</a> <a href="?q=%23%E7%A4%BE%E4%BF%9D">#社保</a> <a href="?q=%23%E6%89%93%E5%B7%A5%E4%BA%BA">#打工人</a> <a href="?q=%23%E7%83%AD%E6%90%9C">#热搜</a> <a href="?q=%23%E7%9C%8B%E9%89%B4">#看鉴</a><br/><br/><i class="emoji" style="background-image:url('//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F9497.png')"><b>🔗</b></i>原文链接<br/>《新浪财经》<a href="https://finance.sina.com.cn/jjxw/2026-10-10/doc-iniutyyz2044159.shtml" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">人社部：要把未参保人员找到动员参保</a><br/>《新浪微博》<a href="https://www.sina.cn/news/detail/5352537697552192.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">数据找人交钱很重要，数据找人发钱也挺重要。</a><br/>《路透社》<a href="https://www.reuters.com/business/world-at-work/chinas-booming-gig-economy-masks-job-market-pain-strains-welfare-system-2026-07-06/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">China’s booming gig economy masks job market pain, strains welfare system</a></div><p><img src="https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/DiAQYgk74XY1UyFtsHDaXh6nzRXh-IJqlmmO6fWxL2zXkAZaTeQmfaVhFESZx4OWgAMFtzyt89e40wcH4TGZozm8OCkaFy2QLhiRU_wJOqTyIGLp606cIah0wq5KH28o0lSvb6VCkok_Us8lPh_1QmXL43kOcwtq6xbU2Gp3wpW37ht9N2lkXPuLXRdQ_E7mSeaOzwLHTtlPzTAWyc7B8JLCWFpgHFzHgo1Ompu4HTrU3LOcwUndexLHqnw4Wb6GUP6CJ7--W6h0m3T8arLuDBEKL86KFru-upoYmSKmF7NYVnlM9al2U56pHyNkHXVSUZ6D1G6vi8j537sgBLsD_w.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/uEdz1-tfbDlSMGQ86V68dygmtaMAcXl6FHO8iYp3zOmZAzzDPVN-DEaPG_YNB2Kii-6PnO_Q8BbdrCMxu-jI03BgXui20x50b5PVQApf8UyqZwNg725072IKmqhUsDdyc9tBkYkoPp5j82ghIQ158dZi2SPD6nyCNLrRQaQRJdUX3kVFY227_oN1zFVSC26mzHF8nhp4prlf_yCUxwdLKUSIFuEkdZk7S9a-2k7NWWc33dFJZmtdB1QiNCsdtD0w7a8xBirsuJASUt7jlzYw6BWWsUTwXPvaI6ODTdiAjWXP1OeHK9By2ez_mjDoJFHHhaovYk9y0F5mrUwxGeiG9w.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/q4dbubsfaD37ThqtQjwSubzNrhkEKP7t3RjGEJIWYJKk-AZsS4zl9nXMPVlJXWJoSOj-KRu2pldRx3wicO3-1asp_sc7gCN5dcczHHJkz1n42KVLGvAXxez4bFLUqt1Hc1RpPpVQ9KAB04-P6gA7NInxWtQCV-nkkyDBSjzmTN8sS3dEOTOyVqulPGI5Io5PdsFcz7sC-P5e8y-TdKNOXhSSRjUbDt32iJdAlcMlyhYrhHJIm_RhHopTJI-NkqCC2Vq_zr1UIHDp1EsEI2quSQnD85N_ynN2Bz0M0hGvcww77DDszZLqdX_g8qnBYhT6Me51xwq6rvdlsVZWzLMNQg.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/lboe0UpGtchFNGwZKojT_ocV-YIjgVFOdTtU9AOvwhfTpGVraX3ncb4xkmXeFQNFfYMF3VIvgfOwQettXAdVnM6dwhsElcrAegGWFSUDRls9dBtJ4ZCiGb3WkZ7-6-1xUvHhXYd4bzvkVwxcfKOebXsbvowHIL-KcBVMwBTg1htyTyHTtlWtdrNc7g_janp_u9WfWaewrJRoFpJOUFGIVRVzMtUliDRWk3FBkHoxN0y5BHvpYXbmOosQsznlTR8urDS1UzUwGeVnjXrkgKi5AAA47RHPB5LoruaH0xK-97M2753OTzyXX2plS_lIKAHcGDi1QA5NCWIw-wx3BK_fEg.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F9497.png" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09FA4A1.png" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09FA4A3.png" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://telegram.org/img/emoji/40/E29DA4.png" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><im